    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7447510549,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-9a0c21c3b169",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1332.0,
      "y": 640.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 297.5,
      "seed": 308866,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Credential and Factors\nA credential is the secret or key that proves\nwho a principal is. [NIST](https://pages.nist.\ngov/800-63-4/sp800-63b.html) names three\nfactors:\n\n- Something you know, such as a password.\n- Something you have, such as a\none-time-password device.\n- Something you are, such as a biometric\nmatch.\n\nMulti-factor authentication (MFA) needs more\nthan one factor. A person can use all three. A\nprogram stores a secret that it knows, or it\nowns a private key or a certificate. Programs\nand Service Accounts describes each kind.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-9a0c21c3b169",
      "originalText": "Credential and Factors\nA credential is the secret or key that proves who a principal is. [NIST](https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63b.html) names three factors:\n\n- Something you know, such as a password.\n- Something you have, such as a one-time-password device.\n- Something you are, such as a biometric match.\n\nMulti-factor authentication (MFA) needs more than one factor. A person can use all three. A program stores a secret that it knows, or it owns a private key or a certificate. Programs and Service Accounts describes each kind.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "credential-and-factors"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
