    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6832827725,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-b7d74ad2784e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1332.0,
      "y": 2460.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 280.0,
      "seed": 278791,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OpenID Connect\nOpenID Connect (OIDC) is an identity layer on\ntop of OAuth 2.0. It lets an application\nverify who the user is, based on the\nauthentication that an authorization server\nperformed ([OIDC Core](https://openid.net/spec\ns/openid-connect-core-1_0.html#Introduction)).\nThe server returns an ID token, a JWT with\nclaims about that sign-in ([OIDC Core](https:/\n/openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html\n#IDToken)). The application asks for it with\nthe scope `openid`, which every OIDC request\nmust contain ([OIDC Core](https://openid.net/s\npecs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html#AuthRequest)\n). Trust and Federation shows a real discovery\ndocument.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-b7d74ad2784e",
      "originalText": "OpenID Connect\nOpenID Connect (OIDC) is an identity layer on top of OAuth 2.0. It lets an application verify who the user is, based on the authentication that an authorization server performed ([OIDC Core](https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html#Introduction)). The server returns an ID token, a JWT with claims about that sign-in ([OIDC Core](https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html#IDToken)). The application asks for it with the scope `openid`, which every OIDC request must contain ([OIDC Core](https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html#AuthRequest)). Trust and Federation shows a real discovery document.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "openid-connect"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
